sequenceDiagram
    participant MM as ModelMesh<br/>Payload Processor
    participant KS as KServe<br/>Inference Logger
    participant TAI as TrustyAI Service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Storage as PVC / MariaDB<br/>Storage Backend
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    participant User as User / Dashboard
    participant Inference as KServe/ModelMesh<br/>Inference Server

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over MM,Storage: Flow 1: ModelMesh Inference Data Ingestion
        MM->>TAI: POST /consumer/kserve/v2<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP (plaintext, no auth)
        TAI->>TAI: ModelMeshInferencePayloadReconciler<br/>reconcile input/output pairs
        TAI->>Storage: Write inference data<br/>File I/O (/inputs/) or JDBC (3306/TCP)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over KS,Storage: Flow 2: KServe Inference Data Ingestion (CloudEvents)
        KS->>TAI: CloudEvent POST<br/>org.kubeflow.serving.inference.request<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP (gzip supported)
        KS->>TAI: CloudEvent POST<br/>org.kubeflow.serving.inference.response<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP (gzip supported)
        TAI->>TAI: KServeInferencePayloadReconciler<br/>reconcile request/response pairs
        TAI->>Storage: Write inference data<br/>File I/O (/inputs/) or JDBC (3306/TCP)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 205)
        Note over User,Prom: Flow 3: Fairness/Drift Metric Computation
        User->>TAI: POST /metrics/group/fairness/spd<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP (via kube-rbac-proxy in prod)
        TAI->>TAI: Schedule recurring metric<br/>PrometheusScheduler (interval: 5s)
        loop Every 5s (configurable)
            TAI->>Storage: Read inference data
            Storage-->>TAI: Inference observations
            TAI->>TAI: Compute SPD/DIR/drift metrics
            TAI->>TAI: Publish as Prometheus gauge<br/>trustyai_spd, trustyai_dir
        end
        Prom->>TAI: GET /q/metrics<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP (Bearer SA token)
        TAI-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics response<br/>trustyai_* gauges
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 230)
        Note over User,Inference: Flow 4: Explainability Computation (ODH only)
        User->>TAI: POST /explainers/local/lime<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP (no auth)
        TAI->>Storage: Read model inference data
        Storage-->>TAI: Historical observations
        TAI->>Inference: gRPC InferRequest<br/>KServe V2 Predict Protocol (plaintext)
        Inference-->>TAI: gRPC InferResponse<br/>Prediction results
        TAI->>TAI: Compute LIME explanation<br/>(multiple inference calls)
        TAI-->>User: JSON explanation response<br/>Feature importance weights
    end
